    <p class="font-sans text-base opacity-80 leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-3xl">
      Do not take my word for it — read the code: agents, reusable tools,
      and reproducible analytics across ten public repositories.
    </p>
    <a href="https://github.com/martin0ne" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
       class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent hover:underline no-underline">
      github.com/martin0ne ↗
    </a>

